'''Skulls''' is a [[legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made up of three mocha brown skulls along the spine, hence the name. The edge of the blade is a shiny silver. The guard is mocha brown, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

